DTSTAMP:20260809T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260809
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260810
SUMMARY:Summer Movie Series: Jurassic Park (1993)
DESCRIPTION:You can see the 1993 original on a real screen in a 1921-seat 
 1925 movie palace\, the way it was meant to be seen. This is a dinosaur k
 id's exact wheelhouse: practical dinosaur effects\, a science plot\, and 
 a room that gasps together. It is rated PG-13 for a reason. The kitchen r
 aptor scene is genuinely tense for a six-year-old.\nPrice: not published 
 by the venue\, so confirm before you go\nArea: Pensacola\nTimes: Sunday 8
 /9 · 3:00 PM\nChecked against the venue's own page on 2026-08-05\nhttps:
 //grayhicks.github.io/coast-guide/events/ev-saenger-jurassic-0809.html
LOCATION:Pensacola Saenger Theatre\, 118 S Palafox\, Pensacola\, FL 32501
URL:https://grayhicks.github.io/coast-guide/events/ev-saenger-jurassic-080
 9.html
END:VEVENT
